# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
/target/

# Generated by Tauri
# will have schema files for capabilities auto-completion
/gen/schemas

# The generated Xcode project. Regenerate with `pnpm ios:init`.
#
# Not committed, despite being a build input, because Xcode writes
# DEVELOPMENT_TEAM into project.pbxproj the moment a signing team is selected —
# which puts an Apple account identifier into the repo. Everything here is
# produced from tauri.conf.json and the APPLE_DEVELOPMENT_TEAM in .env.local,
# so regenerating is lossless. Anything hand-edited here would need that
# reconsidered.
/gen/apple

